### =========================================================================
### SAMRS API TEST SUITE
### =========================================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & CONNECTIVITY
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Public Ping
# Mengetes konektivitas dasar dan status server
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.2 Login (Dapatkan Token)
# @name login
# Gunakan data dari Seeder: admin / password123
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Ambil token dari response login ke variabel dinamis
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

###

### 1.3 Secure Ping (Skenario Sukses)
# Mengetes apakah Middleware berhasil membaca JWT dan mengekstrak TenantID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secure-ping
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

######

### 1.3 Secure Ping (Skenario Sukses)
# Mengetes apakah Middleware berhasil membaca JWT dan mengekstrak TenantID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.4 Secure Ping (Gagal - Tanpa Token)
# Ekspektasi: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secure-ping
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.5 Secure Ping (Gagal - Token Salah)
# Ekspektasi: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secure-ping
Authorization: Bearer token_salah_disini
Accept: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. ROOM MANAGEMENT
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

# TODO:
# Detail Location for tracking asset must be add (building / floor / room / bed)

### 2.1 Create Room
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ruang Melati 500",
    "code": "Mlt-500",
    "location": "Gedung Kedua Lantai 50"
}

### Simpan UUID Ruangan dari response secara dinamis
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.data.id}}

###

### 2.2 Get All Rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 2.3 Get Room By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 2.4 Update Room
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ruang Melati 3000",
    "code": "Mlt-3000",
    "location": "Gedung Kedua Lantai 300"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. BED MANAGEMENT
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Create Bed (Sukses)
# Membuat Bed yang terikat pada RoomID yang baru saja dibuat
# @name createBed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/beds
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "room_id": "{{roomId}}",
    "code": "BED-MWR-100-01"
}

### Simpan ID Bed dari response
@bedId = {{createBed.response.body.data.id}}

###

### 3.2 Create Bed (Gagal - Room ID Ngawur)
# Ekspektasi: 500/404 dengan pesan "ruangan tidak ditemukan atau akses ditolak"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/beds
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "room_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "code": "BED-ERROR"
}

###

### 3.3 Get Beds (By Room)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/beds?room_id={{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.4 Get Bed By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/beds/{{bedId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.5 Update Bed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/beds/{{bedId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "room_id": "{{roomId}}",
    "code": "BED-MWR-100-01",
    "status": "maintenance"
}


