### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ASSET INVENTORY
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Create Asset (Ventilator)
# @name createAsset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "category_id": {{categoryId}},
    "room_id": "{{roomId}}",
    "bed_id": {{bedId}},
    "vendor_id": {{vendorId}},
    "brand_id": {{brandId}},
    "model_id": {{modelId}},
    "code": "VENT-003-4",
    "name": "Ventilator Philips V60",
    "brand": "Philips",
    "model": "V60",
    "status": "ready",
    "purchase_date": "2024-01-15"
}

### Simpan ID Asset dari response
@assetId = {{createAsset.response.body.data.id}}
@assetCode = {{createAsset.response.body.data.code}}
@tenantSlug = rs-pusat

###

### 5.2 Get All Assets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.3 Get Asset By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assets/{{assetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.3.1 Get Asset Timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assets/{{assetId}}/timeline?page=1&per_page=20&sort_by=created_at&sort_dir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.3.1 Get Asset QR (PNG)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assets/{{assetId}}/qr?size=256
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: image/png

###

### 5.3.2 Public Asset (QR scan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/tenants/{{tenantSlug}}/assets/{{assetCode}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.4 Update Asset
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assets/{{assetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "category_id": {{categoryId}},
    "room_id": "{{roomId}}",
    "bed_id": {{bedId}},
    "vendor_id": {{vendorId}},
    "brand_id": {{brandId}},
    "model_id": {{modelId}},
    "code": "VENT-001",
    "name": "Ventilator Philips V60",
    "brand": "Philips",
    "model": "V60",
    "status": "ready",
    "purchase_date": "2024-01-15"
}


