Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.5.3 Get Complaint By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints/{{complaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.5.4 Update Complaint (status)
### Status complain can update (done) with permission from user or not (optional)
