### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.6 MAINTENANCE & CALIBRATION
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.6.1 Create Maintenance Schedule
# @name createMaintenance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "asset_id": "{{assetId}}",
    "schedule_type": "maintenance",
    "title": "Maintenance bulanan",
    "interval_days": 30,
    "next_due_date": "2024-02-15",
    "status": "scheduled",
    "notes": "Checklist standar"
}

### Simpan ID Schedule dari response
@maintenanceId = {{createMaintenance.response.body.data.id}}

###

### 5.6.2 Get All Maintenance Schedules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-schedules?page=1&per_page=20&sort_by=created_at&sort_dir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.6.3 Get Maintenance Schedule By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-schedules/{{maintenanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.6.4 Complete Maintenance Schedule
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-schedules/{{maintenanceId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "note": "Maintenance selesai, unit normal."
}

###


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.6.6 MAINTENANCE DOCUMENTS (MANUAL TESTING MULTIPART)  
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.6.6.1 Upload Document (contoh multipart)
# Ganti path file sesuai lokasi file di mesinmu
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-schedules/{{maintenanceId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SAMRSFormBoundary

------SAMRSFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="doc_type"

certificate
------SAMRSFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="certificate.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/certificate.pdf
------SAMRSFormBoundary--

###

### 5.6.6.2 List Documents
# @name listMaintenanceDocs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-schedules/{{maintenanceId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Simpan ID dokumen maintenance dari response list
@docId = {{listMaintenanceDocs.response.body.data.0.id}}

###

### 5.6.6.3 Download Document
# Ganti {docId} dari response list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-documents/{{docId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/octet-stream

###

### 5.6.6.4 Delete Document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-documents/{{docId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


