### 5.10 STOCK OPNAME
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.10.1 Create Stock Opname Session
# @name createOpname
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock-opnames
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Stock Opname Q1",
    "opname_at": "2024-03-31",
    "notes": "Opname rutin"
}

### Simpan ID Session dari response
@opnameId = {{createOpname.response.body.data.id}}

###

### 5.10.2 Add Stock Opname Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock-opnames/{{opnameId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "asset_id": "{{assetId}}",
    "condition": "match",
    "note": "OK"
}

###

### 5.10.3 List Stock Opname Sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock-opnames?page=1&per_page=20&sort_by=created_at&sort_dir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.10.4 List Stock Opname Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock-opnames/{{opnameId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.10.5 Close Stock Opname Session
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock-opnames/{{opnameId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json


